<title>USA: R.H. Phillips names Motroni CFO.</title>
<headline>R.H. Phillips names Motroni CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ESPARTO, Calif. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>R.H. Phillips Inc said Monday it had named Michael Motroni chief financial officer, replacing Robert Moore.</p>
<p>The company said that Moore, as vice president of finance, will henceforth focus on bank and treasury management and investor relations.</p>
<p>Motroni was most recently vice president of finance and secretary for Calgene Inc CGNE.O, the company said.</p>
<p>R.H. Phillips is a producer of estate bottled wine.</p>
